     "visible": true,
     "kicker": "",
     "title": "",
     "italic": "",
     "body": "An articulated world has functions, distinctions and forms which can themselves become objects of inquiry. The question is how their source remains present through that articulation. A05, Prakāśa–Vimarśa grounds the dossier's positive metaphysical relation: luminous appearing and its self-apprehending power belong together. A06, Vāk extends it into speech; A09, the tattvic differential field extends it into finite worldhood.",
